  "title": "Any roadmap plans for microcontroller boards with cell modems?",
  "body": "I am wondering if we might ever get Rayhunter to operate on something like a LILYGO T-Call A7670 4G 2G ESP32 dev board, etc. I envision turning up a few in my neighborhood, perhaps powered via solar/batteries, that could monitor for attacks and then do something with their GPIOs; flash an LED, etc.",
