      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4BAx_F",
      "body": "With the latest release (v0.11.1), one can now configure wifi client mode to have the device connect _to_ something, allowing it to then send ntfy pushes. This resolved my use case.\r\n\r\nPhone in my pocket, Orbic somewhere on my person, tethered to my phone via wifi hotspot. Any detections are shipped to ntfy, where my phone (and other devices elsewhere) pickup the alert. Quite neat 😄",
